# Scaleoz website

A responsive, static website for Scaleoz. It works locally and can be deployed directly to Vercel or GitHub Pages—no packages or server setup required.

## Run locally

Open `index.html` in a browser, or use the **Live Server** extension in VS Code and select **Go Live**.

## Deploy

Follow [DEPLOYMENT.md](DEPLOYMENT.md) for exact Vercel, GitHub Pages, custom-domain, and Google-indexing instructions.

The contact button opens an email addressed to `scaleoz.buisness@gmail.com`; the call and social links open the corresponding contact service on supported devices.
